s://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974779_1264355847769358_4641506711692728623_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NgmVyHCL7mgQ7kNvwFIMank&_nc_oc=AdogaoDC8d8k4TewwAvSk8ancThlloK8uRWJoTWpeJLL6O7XwZQojM0YzMOa00MFCWk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUf0RpffGjNkRgEI0B59MrsUgSmpKJYtuNCKIRPWjO6vA&oe=6B0F051D"}, "display_name": "Pandora", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Open the box and gain the powers that reside within. Open the box and interrupt their slumber ... if you dare.\n\nPandora is a retro-style arcade shooter infused with the haptics and the scale of VR. Face hordes of demons and beat your highscores - or try your luck in various short but demanding challenge scenarios. Let them drown in a barrage of magic, manipulate time and collect crystals for upgrades and to unleash your most powerful attacks! \n\nUse headphones for better experience.", "short_description": "Open the box and gain the powers that reside within. Open the box and interrupt their slumber ... if you dare.\n\nPandora is a retro-style arcade shooter infused with the haptics and the scale of VR. Face hordes of demons and beat your highscores - or try your luck in various short but demanding challenge scenarios. Let them drown in a barrage of magic, manipulate time and collect crystals for upgrades and to unleash your most powerful attacks! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sucurema.com/en/privacy-policy-pandora-vr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sucurema GmbH", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sucurema.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE",